# These files are read inside a Linux container. With core.autocrlf=true (the
# Windows default) they would be checked out with CRLF, which breaks shell line
# continuations and shebangs. Scoped deliberately to the Docker setup so the
# rest of the repository keeps its current line-ending behaviour.
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.conf text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
.dockerignore text eol=lf
